# CODEOWNERS for Dark Factory PRs.
#
# Strategy: CODEOWNERS is a RISK FILTER, not a default reviewer assignment.
# Paths with no owner are satisfied by Copilot's review alone, which is what
# allows low-risk PRs to auto-merge without a human approver.
# Paths with an owner require that owner before the PR can merge, regardless
# of Copilot.

# Default: no owner. Copilot review is sufficient.
# (No line for `*` on purpose.)

# Database migrations and schemas
/migrations/                     @your-team/db
**/*.sql                         @your-team/db
**/schema.prisma                 @your-team/db
**/schema.graphql                @your-team/db

# Infrastructure
/infra/                          @your-team/platform
/terraform/                      @your-team/platform
/k8s/                            @your-team/platform
/helm/                           @your-team/platform
/Dockerfile                      @your-team/platform
/docker-compose.yml              @your-team/platform

# CI configuration
/.github/                        @your-team/platform

# Authentication, authorization, and secrets
/src/auth/                       @your-team/security
/src/security/                   @your-team/security
/internal/auth/                  @your-team/security
SECURITY.md                      @your-team/security

# Public API surfaces
**/openapi.yaml                  @your-team/api
**/openapi.json                  @your-team/api
**/*.proto                       @your-team/api
